+## Print record
+
+The working sheet opens on light paper with both plates visible. The Dark paper control changes the surrounding interface. The print stays on its original cream substrate in each appearance. Keep the source field names Kelp, Oxide and Register. The supplied Register value is “1,000 × 740 pixels per plate”.
